#. official: map.18.0.0
#: src/menu.py
msgid "Three items were needed to reach the Isle of Dragons, which is south of Brecconary."
msgstr "If you would reach the evil island visible from Tantegel's shore, you will require the three sacred artefacts."

#. official: map.18.0.0
#: src/menu.py
msgid "I gathered these items, reached the island, and there defeated a creature of great evil."
msgstr "I gathered them, crossed to that accursed isle, and destroyed the source of all evil."

#. official: map.18.0.0
#: src/menu.py
