msgstr "Before my passing, I entrusted the three objects to three great sages."

#. official: map.18.0.0
#: src/menu.py
msgid "Their descendants will protect the items until thy quest leads thee to seek them out."
msgstr "If the fates have been kind, their descendants guard them still. Seek them out!"

#. official: map.18.0.0
#: src/menu.py
msgid "When a new evil arises, find the three items, then fight!"
msgstr "When evil rules the ill-starred isle once more, gather the hallowed triad, and strike a blow for the cause of light."

