#. official: map.0.1.1
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Thou hast brought us peace, again."
msgstr "Lo, peace hath returned unto our realm, and all is thanks to thee!"

#. official: map.33.2.0
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Thou hast found the Ball of Light."
msgstr "Thou hast wrested the Sphere of Light from the Dragonlord's death grip!"

#. official: map.33.2.0
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Radiance streams forth as thy hands touch the object and hold it aloft."
msgstr "As thou holdest the sphere aloft, a blinding light radiates from deep within its core..."

#. official: map.33.2.1
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Across the land spreads the brilliance until all shadows are banished and peace is restored."
msgstr "The great evil has been banished, and the world knows peace once more!"

#. official: map.0.1.19
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Come now, King Lorik awaits."
msgstr "Tarry not! Hie thee to His Majesty, post-haste!"

#. official: map.34.1.1
#: src/ending.py
msgid "The legends have proven true."
msgstr "All is as the prophecies foretold. The words of the ancients do ring clear and true!"

#. official: map.34.1.3
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Thou art indeed of the line of Erdrick."
msgstr "The promised hero in whose veins floweth the blood of mighty Erdrick is none other than thee."

#. official: map.34.1.3
#: src/ending.py
msgid "It is thy right to rule over this land."
msgstr "If there be a better man to rule this land, I know him not."

#. official: map.34.1.3
#: src/ending.py
msgid "Will thou take my place?"
msgstr "Wilt thou take the throne in my stead?"

#. official: map.34.1.3
#: src/ending.py
msgid "If ever I am to rule a country, it must be a land that I myself find."
msgstr "Were I ever to rule, it must needs be o'er a realm of mine own founding."

#. official: map.34.1.5
#: src/ending.py
msgid "I wish to go with thee on thy journey."
msgstr "Take me with thee, my dearest heart!"

#. official: map.34.1.5
#: src/ending.py
msgid "May I travel as thy companion?"
msgstr "Pray, forsake me not! Wilt thou take me for thy companion?"

#. official: map.34.1.6
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
#: src/ending.py
msgid "But thou must."
msgstr "Thou wilt not!? Hmph! Perhaps thou didst not hear me correctly, beloved..."

#. official: map.34.1.7
#: data/text/dialog_lookup_table.py
#: src/ending.py
msgid "I'm so happy!"
msgstr "Thou wilt? Oh, joy! Then let us away, my love!"

#: src/ending.py
msgid "unless the dragons return again."
msgstr "unless the dragons return again."

